// Flattened bandit.rs2's [ai_queue3,brawling_bandit] table.
// npc_param(death_drop) is unset (null) on this NPC's config, so no
// guaranteed drop. map_members is always true, so the bloodrune branch is
// included unconditionally. Slots 126-127 (2/128) match no branch: no
// additional drop.
